    "caveats": [
      "the unit is the WHOLE response, not a claim - a negative is a response most of which is normally supported, carrying one unsupported span",
      "the evidence field is the RAGTruth `prompt`, which is the task instruction plus (for QA) the question plus the passages - not a passage alone"
    ]
  },
